# Build targets

build Benchmarks_Debug: phony bin/Debug/Benchmarks.exe
build Benchmarks_Release: phony bin/Release/Benchmarks.exe
build Benchmarks_Native: phony bin/Native/Benchmarks.exe

# Project phony targets

build Benchmarks: phony bin/Debug/Benchmarks.exe

